function	UltraAlloc (|int64| N = 1|uint64|<<31, |&byte|)
			cpp_wrapper JB_Mem__mmap
			description "Its just mmmap. Not even mmap. but mmmap. Like mmap, but a little better. OK so its wrapping mmap(). Turns out you can rely on the VM system to do crazy things for you. So why not allocate 2GB and just never use almost any of it. Even if you only use a tiny 16K of it. The system doesn't care, right? It works on 16KB page basis anyhow, right?"

